  "description": "Um, the only daughter of a count, was born as Arena's handmaid.  \n'If I recite a spell, the lady can get what she wants.'  \nAn accidental favor given only once, and a body swapped with that of the owner.  \n‘Remember, kind maid. Magic like a dream only lasts for one year.'  \nUm became the countess's daughter in an instant!  \nHowever, Arena was scheduled to be engaged... … .  \n\"I've changed my mind, Lady Kreum.\"  \nAllod clasped Oum's hand and smiled, widening his eyes. Goosebumps ran down her spine. Even though I knew that the owner of that smile wasn't me.  \n“It’s okay if we continue until marriage.”  \nThe breath in front of his nose, like a whisper, hardened his grip. As she twisted, Arrod wrapped herself around Um's waist.  \nThe next moment, Um's face turned white.  \n***  \nThe time given is only 1 year!  \nYou must get out of here.\n\n[Original Novel](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=3849179)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10756322), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/5101001312)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://www.comico.jp/comic/8576)",
